{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>自稱是諸葛亮第63代後人的諸葛紫岐（Marie），自2012年與Neway二公子薛嘉麟結婚後，成功躋身上流，搖身一變成為豪門闊太，她亦經常在社交平台大曬各種奢華行頭，高調炫富！日前諸葛紫岐迎來43歲生日，她在社交平台上載了一段法國頂尖時尚品牌LV為她慶祝生日的短片，盡顯VIP地位！</p><figure><img alt=\"豪門闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167527791361527808820379.jpeg/kdof9T2FCglDWPeAJf99oo1BDVeepOSJTNRr6UzUa-k\"/><figcaption>豪門闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"豪門闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167527793974710272018479.jpeg/-Mg1F6zONSm1h-k0QbOo-i4ak5Htx7ea70ikzO9IpMw\"/><figcaption>豪門闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"LV VIP！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252255944871936781526.jpeg/lMXvRBXzjHi0GXV7uVhVcZbsc7m8a5B53fnggd354IE\"/><figcaption>LV VIP！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"LV VIP！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252567484928000921804.jpeg/4mNpVj68kP5cV0Y-d_53mOyxeE9i7Qa4lIswYpSLMGI\"/><figcaption>LV VIP！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬名牌行頭！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252855335817216145367.jpeg/c8gwckGfRZRKV5EgOPGCcFfzY5arnhUvbpfBFW6XwRU\"/><figcaption>大曬名牌行頭！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"LV VIP！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252253549793280219034.jpeg/ZPLNbm1qIP4K8p1loe7fnLrkBY-srqHMtJKSNLSSkjQ\"/><figcaption>LV VIP！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生活奢華。（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252251049857024572169.jpeg/CAZA_1jnx82duDT3xWAbYZUVPe25VygR_2ZNS_9mTUs\"/><figcaption>生活奢華。（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"諸葛紫岐同老公薛嘉麟。（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260220/1101575066048532480584601.jpeg/VhtWrdk6O7oH9eaEm_-HFwD8ob-aJRJARViQF0VYkBc\"/><figcaption>諸葛紫岐同老公薛嘉麟。（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><p>諸葛紫岐43歲生日大曬奢華生活　獲LV尊貴慶生盡顯VIP地位</p><p>片中所見，現場以氣球佈置，一身名牌的諸葛紫岐更獲LV員工為她送上生日蛋糕慶生，盡顯VIP地位！出生於北京的諸葛紫岐，6歲時移居加拿大溫哥華，自稱是蜀漢丞相諸葛亮第63代後人，她曾以藝名諸葛一文（Noriko）在當地華語電視台新時代電視的國語頻道城市電視，擔任節目《城市妙聽聞》的主持，其後於香港發展，2012年與薛嘉麟結婚後，相繼誕下兩子。</p><figure><img alt=\"諸葛紫岐獲LV尊貴慶生。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167526269764767744934617.jpeg/nJS2V24MOwyhqWyBWL5m0ikohqVoScWQpZcUaKWXFGg\"/><figcaption>諸葛紫岐獲LV尊貴慶生。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"諸葛紫岐獲LV尊貴慶生。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167526267491323904639158.jpeg/qUbvi0GDEuPC2IYUbtWETqebjK7ttevqAD0xCQA9MQk\"/><figcaption>諸葛紫岐獲LV尊貴慶生。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"諸葛紫岐獲LV尊貴慶生。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167526264903307264391852.jpeg/6TAfh8ZnuJ7kORUWJv6j27J2j68qZhbovlhjpL5YY6Q\"/><figcaption>諸葛紫岐獲LV尊貴慶生。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生日快樂！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167526723001257984315487.jpeg/dbxB_rfSewQY8VDSmROJMi3Wb3znC3IXHL5WKhy-Vio\"/><figcaption>生日快樂！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生日快樂！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167526720740397056312698.jpeg/05UOk5PGXYZwJcHe0_xHMEbgseMLguy-yMLqn8jC6p8\"/><figcaption>生日快樂！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生日快樂！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167526718118825984073924.jpeg/4nSYM0OjuN_3cMv1-TkvzqPfAt6IJgqR9nn6AfZ5-gE\"/><figcaption>生日快樂！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出席晚宴。（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260220/1101575068737212416276835.jpeg/Avfq9-ihzxrl95anOEEu_pSxVVo5ND4VDqLWDQ6i1g0\"/><figcaption>出席晚宴。（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><p>諸葛紫岐曾與老公傳婚變　進駐2億西半山豪宅榮升仁濟醫院總理</p><p>不過諸葛紫岐與老公婚後不時傳出婚變，有傳她為發展娛樂生意而冷落另一半，令二人婚姻亮紅燈，更各自在微博訴苦，她更曾一度暴瘦，患上抑鬱症，但她就多次強調夫妻感情不受影響，亦曾公開感謝老公：「多謝你一直陪著我！」近年諸葛紫岐由原本的半億跑馬地豪宅搬到叫價2億的西半山4,000呎豪宅頂樓Penthouse相連戶單位，坐擁無敵海景，又經常周遊列國，生活無憂！今年諸葛紫岐更榮升仁濟醫院總理，她曾在接受《香港01》訪問時透露長子已到英國讀書：「我諗住佢唔啱，但係佢好快適應到。我同佢講我都好掛住你，不如返嚟啦，佢都話鍾意喺嗰邊。（有冇叛逆期？）而家都還OK，哥哥12歲，細佬7歲，但係佢都有自己諗法。」</p><figure><img alt=\"去年諸葛紫岐亦獲LV慶生。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252119517007872175986.jpeg/VbtzhVHSNUggxb0O2aB8QktI7o5n5rJQNlj17DZY9ew\"/><figcaption>去年諸葛紫岐亦獲LV慶生。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"諸葛紫岐同老公薛嘉麟。（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240406/853287262857728000459170.jpeg/UA51vFDowPYa8sd2I66yZAh749zh_Oeq4h11U-IddVM\"/><figcaption>諸葛紫岐同老公薛嘉麟。（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"多次強調夫妻感情不受影響。（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210107/423842424821911552091253.jpeg/FuKTaG6qZfzwY_JN7DXGbuT9ppu7-3zAUvt3TlL7d04\"/><figcaption>多次強調夫妻感情不受影響。（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"諸葛紫岐首任仁濟醫院總理。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260418/1121972970479292416069873.jpeg/eQZCYfx6Y-K_Ew5qThPG_F0D5uXEfVGBxfZrXeD2a10\"/><figcaption>諸葛紫岐首任仁濟醫院總理。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220306/577196563923734528756910.jpeg/Xi0ljktSFvWqQIxBnl_CkG1LjV_wfRTLoeWSO6Hlkjs\"/><figcaption>闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210612/480459177664581632835460.jpeg/2ye_vMoWY4Py335tc_ioSn-ru7fimbyZMu3KFDLtyhQ\"/><figcaption>闊太！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全身都係名牌！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210107/423843557758341120435627.jpeg/uUmLck56LwYA34B2o3cnlWUSOS7ACtYXjAyuQIwMrkA\"/><figcaption>全身都係名牌！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本旅行！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252952425697280542180.jpeg/EFH223RvXoI96YTo0YypmK6RkgnPVNQWCOnglAjp4JQ\"/><figcaption>日本旅行！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"豪宅！（IG@mariezhuge）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250821/1035252949686685696016587.jpeg/0Pm-nG8nutYO27dXnyvnGWD0NfaXEz9gBmFJhgZhSYY\"/><figcaption>豪宅！（IG@mariezhuge）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T05:07:10.600296+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1164,"images":24,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}